// (mutopiaproject.org, maintained by Keith OHara, public domain), read from its MIDI file.
// Each note is [midinote, beats (quarter = 1), legato]; notes tie across bar lines where the score
// does. \stretch 2 slows it to about the score's pace (quarter = 60 in the MIDI) at the engine's
// 136 BPM, so a 9/8 bar is 9 engine beats.
